'''Byrak''' was a historical region of [[Northern Meran]] (?), populated mainly at the time of the [[Byrakan Wars|Ottelian conquest]] by the [[Byrakans]], the [[TRIBE 2]], and the [[TRIBE 3]], roughly corresponding to present-day [[Qym]], [[NEIGHBOR]], and parts of [[OTHER COUNTRIES]] (?). The exact borders of Byrak, as described by the [[Ottelians]] varied over time due to conquests, migrations, political changes, and the [[Byrakans]]' evolving understanding of a shared territory. 

